  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"K\u0131l\u0131\xE7 D\xF6rtl\xFCs\xFC\" kart\u0131n\u0131
    se\xE7tin.\n\nAte\u015Fin \xFCzerinde y\xFCr\xFCmek ya da \xE7ivilere basarak
    ilerlemek nas\u0131ld\u0131r bilir misin {{isim}}? Yapmad\u0131\u011F\u0131n
    i\xE7in bilemezsin. Peki yapar m\u0131yd\u0131n? Bu kart, baz\u0131 ama\xE7lar
    u\u011Fruna bunu yapt\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131, atlatman gereken bir d\xF6nem
    i\xE7in sabretti\u011Fini, \xE7ekti\u011Fin s\u0131k\u0131nt\u0131ya ra\u011Fmen
    ilerlemesini bildi\u011Fini anlat\u0131yor. Amac\u0131na nihayet nail olmu\u015Fsun
    fakat o \xF6zverili d\xF6nemin senden \xE7ok \u015Fey al\u0131p g\xF6t\xFCrm\xFC\u015F.
    Sonras\u0131nda akl\u0131n\u0131 bo\u015Faltmaya, dinlenmeye ve ruhsal olarak
    yenilenmeye ihtiya\xE7 duymu\u015Fsun. Enerjini yeniden toplad\u0131\u011F\u0131nda
    ise aya\u011Fa kalk\u0131p kendine yeni hedefler belirlemi\u015Fsin."
